---
import DesignDocLayout from "../../../layouts/DesignDocLayout.astro";
---
<DesignDocLayout title="ManabuPlay — Mockup répartition des tiers" active="mockups" containerClass="wrap">
  <style is:global>
    :root {
      --bg: #090811;
      --panel: rgba(15, 12, 26, 0.94);
      --panel-soft: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --line-strong: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.28);
      --text: #f4f2ff;
      --muted: #9e98b8;
      --cyan: #22d3ee;
      --pink: #e879f9;
      --violet: #a78bfa;
      --easy: #22d3ee;
      --mid: #facc15;
      --hard: #fb923c;
      --expert: #f87171;
      --green: #4ade80;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% -10%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.22) 0%, transparent 70%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 35% 35% at 92% 14%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.14) 0%, transparent 60%),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font: 500 18px/1.55 "Chakra Petch", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      padding: 24px 12px 40px;
    }

    .wrap {
      width: min(1400px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .hero,
    .variant {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.18);
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
    }

    .hero { padding: 20px; }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 32px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.26);
      background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12);
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }

    .hero h1 {
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .hero h1 span { color: var(--pink); }
    .hero p { margin-top: 10px; max-width: 86ch; color: #c9c4de; }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .variant {
      padding: 16px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .variant-head {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .variant-kicker {
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .variant p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .cartouche {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--panel-soft);
    }

    .cartouche-line {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .cartouche-label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .cartouche-value {
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .tier-line {
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .tier-line .easy { color: var(--easy); }
    .tier-line .mid { color: var(--mid); }
    .tier-line .hard { color: var(--hard); }
    .tier-line .expert { color: var(--expert); }

    .chips {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 34px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .chip.easy { border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.24); background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12); color: #d7fbff; }
    .chip.mid { border-color: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.28); background: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.12); color: #fde68a; }
    .chip.hard { border-color: rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.28); background: rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.12); color: #fed7aa; }
    .chip.expert { border-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.28); background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.12); color: #fecaca; }

    .stack {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .bar {
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      display: flex;
    }

    .seg.easy { width: 33%; background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.9); }
    .seg.mid { width: 27%; background: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.9); }
    .seg.hard { width: 23%; background: rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.92); }
    .seg.expert { width: 17%; background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.92); }

    .legend {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .legend-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      min-height: 36px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--panel-soft);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .legend-left {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .dot.easy { background: var(--easy); }
    .dot.mid { background: var(--mid); }
    .dot.hard { background: var(--hard); }
    .dot.expert { background: var(--expert); }

    .mock-note {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--panel-soft);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .mock-note strong { color: var(--text); }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .legend { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Mockup</span>
    <h1>Répartition des <span>tiers</span></h1>
    <p>Le but n’est pas seulement de montrer des pourcentages. Il faut que ça aide à lire un pack d’un coup, sans avoir l’air d’une ligne de debug. Les exemples ci-dessous partent d’un pack à 34 mots avec la répartition cible v0.1 : 12 faciles, 9 moyens, 8 difficiles, 5 experts.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <article class="variant">
      <div class="variant-head">
        <div class="variant-kicker">Option A</div>
        <h2>Ligne éditoriale</h2>
        <p>Version directe, proche d’un vrai cartouche produit. Lisible, peu technique, mais assez longue.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cartouche">
        <div class="tier-line">Mots : 34 · <span class="easy">Facile 35%</span> · <span class="mid">Moyen 26%</span> · <span class="hard">Difficile 24%</span> · <span class="expert">Expert 15%</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="mock-note">
        <strong>Intérêt :</strong> très naturel.
        <span>On comprend tout sans connaître T1/T2/T3/T4.</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="variant">
      <div class="variant-head">
        <div class="variant-kicker">Option B</div>
        <h2>Ligne mixte</h2>
        <p>On montre à la fois le nombre de mots et la part relative. Plus utile pour l’édition que pour le grand public.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cartouche">
        <div class="tier-line">34 mots · <span class="easy">12 faciles</span> · <span class="mid">9 moyens</span> · <span class="hard">8 difficiles</span> · <span class="expert">5 experts</span></div>
        <div class="cartouche-line">
          <span class="cartouche-label">Répartition</span>
          <span class="cartouche-value">35% · 26% · 24% · 15%</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mock-note">
        <strong>Intérêt :</strong> meilleur équilibre lecture / pilotage.
        <span>Ça donne la densité réelle du pack, pas juste des pourcentages.</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="variant">
      <div class="variant-head">
        <div class="variant-kicker">Option C</div>
        <h2>Chips couleur</h2>
        <p>Très admin, plus modulaire, bon quand l’espace horizontal est limité ou quand on veut scanner vite.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cartouche">
        <div class="tier-line">34 mots</div>
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip easy">12 faciles · 35%</span>
          <span class="chip mid">9 moyens · 26%</span>
          <span class="chip hard">8 difficiles · 24%</span>
          <span class="chip expert">5 experts · 15%</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mock-note">
        <strong>Intérêt :</strong> le plus robuste visuellement.
        <span>Facile à réutiliser sur cartes pack, cartouches et futur quiz admin.</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="variant">
      <div class="variant-head">
        <div class="variant-kicker">Option D</div>
        <h2>Barre + légende</h2>
        <p>La plus visuelle. Bonne si on veut sentir la densité du pack d’un coup, un peu moins compacte.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="bar">
          <div class="seg easy"></div>
          <div class="seg mid"></div>
          <div class="seg hard"></div>
          <div class="seg expert"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="legend">
          <div class="legend-item">
            <span class="legend-left"><span class="dot easy"></span>Facile</span>
            <span>10 · 33%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-item">
            <span class="legend-left"><span class="dot mid"></span>Moyen</span>
            <span>8 · 27%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-item">
            <span class="legend-left"><span class="dot hard"></span>Difficile</span>
            <span>7 · 23%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-item">
            <span class="legend-left"><span class="dot expert"></span>Expert</span>
            <span>5 · 17%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mock-note">
        <strong>Intérêt :</strong> très lisible et pédagogique.
        <span>Probablement mieux pour la page d’accueil du lecteur que pour une petite card.</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</DesignDocLayout>
